Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.96,0:01:57.50,Main-207+,Ashura,0,0,0,,弟兄們，你們先上山去！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.50,0:01:59.46,Main-207+,Thief,0,0,0,,酒天丸老大！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.22,0:02:04.96,Main-207+,Ashura,0,0,0,,我有種不祥的預感。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.81,0:02:12.39,Main-207+,Jack,0,0,0,,他瘋了……
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.27,0:02:17.51,Main-207+,Hawkins,0,0,0,,一瞬間就結束了。\N根本不夠他醒酒。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.75,0:02:47.92,Main-207+,Law,0,0,0,,草帽小子！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.45,0:03:21.99,Main-207+,Pirate,0,0,0,,凱多大人！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.96,0:03:24.00,Main-207+,Pirate,0,0,0,,糟了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.23,0:03:46.79,Main-207+,Child,0,0,0,,娘啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.79,0:03:50.12,Main-207+,Citizen,0,0,0,,可惡！我的房子……！我的房子！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.12,0:03:51.40,Main-207+,Child,0,0,0,,爹啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.35,0:04:20.10,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}三檔！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.78,0:05:06.14,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}橡膠……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.12,0:05:18.08,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}象槍！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.21,0:05:56.65,Main-207+,Pirate,0,0,0,,凱多大人從天上掉下來了！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.13,0:06:18.89,Main-207+,Pirate,0,0,0,,那是誰？！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.89,0:06:24.11,Main-207+,Pirate,0,0,0,,啊！那就是打敗\N橫綱浦島和赫戴姆老大的傢伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.12,0:06:38.58,Main-207+,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,阿菊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.58,0:06:41.53,Main-207+,Kikunojo,0,0,0,,我在這裡，錦大人！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.90,0:06:47.34,Main-207+,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,阿菊！妳沒事吧？！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.95,0:06:48.76,Main-207+,Kikunojo,0,0,0,,是的。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.83,0:06:50.89,Main-207+,Kikunojo,0,0,0,,可是……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.45,0:07:10.54,Main-207+,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,御田城！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.83,0:07:19.81,Main-207+,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,桃之助少爺！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.38,0:07:24.46,Main-207+,Kikunojo,0,0,0,,請等一下！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.76,0:07:28.46,Main-207+,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,為什麼？！我們得確認他平安無事才行！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.46,0:07:31.55,Main-207+,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,要是他出了什麼事……！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.55,0:07:34.68,Main-207+,Kikunojo,0,0,0,,我也是這麼想的！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.02,0:07:38.89,Main-207+,Kikunojo,0,0,0,,可是你現在\N不是還有別人得擔心嗎？！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.52,0:07:42.47,Main-207+,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,阿鶴……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.40,0:07:47.49,Main-207+,Kikunojo,0,0,0,,他隨時可能醒來\N繼續大鬧一場！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.49,0:07:50.15,Main-207+,Kikunojo,0,0,0,,要是那樣，施捨小鎮就會……
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.16,0:07:55.59,Main-207+,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,我明白了。我這就\N趕往施捨小鎮。{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.04,0:07:59.35,Main-207+,Kin'emon,0,0,0,,阿菊，照顧好桃之助少爺！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.35,0:08:00.16,Main-207+,Kikunojo,0,0,0,,遵命！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.51,0:08:18.75,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,你們沒事吧！你們\N總算是逃出來了對吧？！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.75,0:08:19.94,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,弟兄們？！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.00,0:08:22.89,Main-207+,Pirate,0,0,0,,斯皮德夫人！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.80,0:08:26.69,Main-207+,Pirate,0,0,0,,撐住啊！發生什麼事了？！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.69,0:08:29.19,Main-207+,Pirate,0,0,0,,我還以為她離開鎮上了！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.19,0:08:33.13,Main-207+,Pirate,0,0,0,,她剛從凱多大人身上摔下來！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.80,0:08:38.12,Main-207+,Pirate,0,0,0,,斯皮德夫人！斯皮德夫人！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.12,0:08:39.78,Main-207+,Pirate,0,0,0,,你到底是什麼人？！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.78,0:08:41.79,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,欸，是馬妞！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.79,0:08:43.43,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,馬妞！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.71,0:08:47.28,Main-207+,Pirate,0,0,0,,斯皮德夫人！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.11,0:08:49.96,Main-207+,Pirate,0,0,0,,你是……
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.36,0:08:55.85,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,你怎麼會在這裡？！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.85,0:08:59.60,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,阿玉呢？！妳把她送回家了吧？！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.89,0:09:05.06,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,快告訴我，馬妞！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.79,0:09:09.74,Main-207+,Speed,0,0,0,,總督凱多在半路上發現了我們……{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.67,0:09:12.53,Main-207+,Speed,0,0,0,,我試著抵抗……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.55,0:09:17.28,Main-207+,Speed,0,0,0,,卻沒能保護好……
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.13,0:09:20.18,Main-207+,Speed,0,0,0,,我的主人！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.27,0:09:32.92,Main-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,妳要去哪，斯皮德？！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.59,0:09:36.30,Main-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,馬妞！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.49,0:10:02.70,Main-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,我收到了一則奇怪的通報……{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.80,0:10:34.67,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,可惡！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.17,0:10:37.99,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,我當時真該……
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.11,0:10:40.96,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,留在她身邊的！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.28,0:10:45.95,Main-207+,Law,0,0,0,,草帽小子！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.37,0:10:49.12,Main-207+,Law,0,0,0,,你在幹嘛？！快跑啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.12,0:10:53.83,Main-207+,Law,0,0,0,,他那麼大隻，八成\N根本不知道是被誰打的！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.83,0:10:55.89,Main-207+,Law,0,0,0,,現在還來得及！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.55,0:10:58.26,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,他把阿玉抓走了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.55,0:11:00.80,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,錦右衛門他們……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.72,0:11:03.92,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,你的夥伴、我的夥伴……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.97,0:11:07.43,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,都還不知道是不是平安！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.11,0:11:10.43,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,只要我現在把他揍趴……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.43,0:11:12.06,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,一切不就都結束了嗎？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.16,0:11:18.83,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,凱多！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.36,0:11:22.16,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,我在這邊！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.31,0:11:56.61,Main-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,你是……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.82,0:11:59.96,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,魯夫。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.56,0:12:03.07,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,將來要成為\N海賊王的男人！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.25,0:12:16.62,Main-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}爆炎吐息！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.67,0:12:50.43,Main-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,你竟然來到了……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.43,0:12:52.45,Main-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,這和之國！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.76,0:12:54.54,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}三檔！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.76,0:13:52.22,Main-207+,Law,0,0,0,,他這下闖大禍了！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.22,0:13:55.14,Main-207+,Law,0,0,0,,他把一切都搞砸了！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.78,0:14:49.02,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}橡膠……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.55,0:15:04.24,Flashbacks-207+,Tama,0,0,0,,我{\i1}永遠{\i0}忘不了今天嚐到的那碗{\i1}紅豆湯{\i0}\N還有那顆蘋果的滋味！{Z}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.59,0:15:13.65,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}橡膠象槍亂打！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.86,0:16:57.92,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,我要把你揍飛，凱多！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.33,0:17:07.21,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}橡膠……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.25,0:17:11.05,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}灰熊……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.05,0:17:14.20,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}麥格農！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.14,0:18:43.22,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}四檔！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.74,0:18:45.27,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}彈簧人！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.61,0:18:59.45,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,你竟敢……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.91,0:19:04.37,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,招惹我的夥伴，你這混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.67,0:19:18.92,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}橡膠……
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.55,0:19:23.69,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}猿王槍！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.03,0:20:10.56,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}橡膠……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.28,0:20:14.85,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}雙重大蛇砲！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.11,0:20:25.00,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}橡膠……
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.62,0:20:33.37,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}猿王風琴！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.90,0:21:39.98,Main-207+,Ashura,0,0,0,,那傢伙到底是誰？
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.53,0:22:34.95,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}橡膠……
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.88,0:22:45.84,Main-207+,Luffy,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}大猿王槍！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.84,0:22:51.93,Main-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}雷鳴八卦！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.99,0:24:00.62,Main-207+,Law,0,0,0,,那個笨蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.41,0:24:14.05,Main-207+,Pirate,0,0,0,,真不敢相信。他竟然還有氣。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.62,0:24:17.38,Main-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,我就知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.38,0:24:18.00,Main-207+,Pirate,0,0,0,,什麼？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.82,0:24:23.70,Main-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,我分不清那是他不屈的鬥志\N還是在逞強……
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.70,0:24:26.65,Main-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,但他一直死死瞪著我。
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.05,0:24:41.41,Main-207+,Pirate,0,0,0,,在我看來他只是昏過去了……
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.56,0:25:04.89,Main-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,你剛才說你要成為什麼樣的王來著？
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.76,0:25:07.26,Main-207+,Kaido,0,0,0,,小子？！
